---
source: crates/specforge-cli/src/main.rs
expression: command.clone().render_long_help().to_string()
---
Scaffold a new extension project

Usage: specforge new [OPTIONS] <NAME>

Arguments:
  <NAME>
          Extension name (e.g. @you/my-ext)

Options:
      --extension
          Scaffold an extension project (SDK-authored wasm)

      --path <PATH>
          Directory to scaffold into
          
          [default: .]

      --format <FORMAT>
          Output format: human or json
          
          [default: human]
          [possible values: human, json]

  -h, --help
          Print help
